  "details": "```c#\n\nvar a = new DataList();\n\na.Add(1);\n\nDebug.Log(a.Contains(1)); // true\n\n \n\nVRCJson.TrySerializeToJson(a, JsonExportType.Minify, out var c);\n\nVRCJson.TryDeserializeFromJson(c.String, out var d);\n\nvar e = d.DataList;\n\nDebug.Log(e.Contains(1)); // false\n\nvar f = a[0];\n\nDebug.Log(e.Contains(f)); // false\n\nDebug.Log(e.Contains(f.Double)); // true\n\n```",
